IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q17-ATM-DENOMINATION.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(6).
01 WS-500 PIC 9(4).
01 WS-200 PIC 9(4).
01 WS-100 PIC 9(4).
01 WS-REMAIN PIC 9(6).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT
    IF WS-AMOUNT <= 0 OR FUNCTION MOD(WS-AMOUNT, 100) NOT = 0
        DISPLAY "INVALID AMOUNT"
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-500 = WS-AMOUNT / 500
        COMPUTE WS-REMAIN = FUNCTION MOD(WS-AMOUNT, 500)
        COMPUTE WS-200 = WS-REMAIN / 200
        COMPUTE WS-REMAIN = FUNCTION MOD(WS-REMAIN, 200)
        COMPUTE WS-100 = WS-REMAIN / 100
        DISPLAY "500: " WS-500
        DISPLAY "200: " WS-200
        DISPLAY "100: " WS-100
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
